Framework
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Anamorph is built with the JUCE framework (Raw Material Software Limited),
pinned to JUCE 9.0.0 (commit f8f8864172464b9adf9eba6101e1f784838d1597).
The JUCE Framework modules are dual-licensed under the AGPLv3 and the
commercial JUCE 9 licence. Anamorph is a closed-source commercial product,
which cannot satisfy the AGPLv3 arm; obtaining the commercial JUCE licence
is an open owner action — see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md §"Open licensing
decisions" and docs/architecture/RELEASE_HARDENING_PLAN.md.

